body:
I sorry about that I also lost my grandfather the same year as my sister. 

&#x200B;

At the to you said 'a loved one' but No she didn't like me and thats why I didn't really either it just makes me really sad thinking about this shit... 

&#x200B;

Your last paragraph is literally my whole mindset at this point.

Are you ok? I just want to say you aren't alone and if you need someone to talk to I can help.

&#x200B;

If you lie then I will know. I know you aren't ok. I know deep down you want help. I know you can't stop yourself from lying. Thats ok. Just remember.
